                        "target_lang_word": "barely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "barely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70fe6b4c-10e1-3dec-bf70-0b7957276117",
                                        "entry_id": "29a03265-b143-3681-8c51-5df023293b4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By a small margin.."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c0437d8-4d66-40ba-9d8e-2997023fa378",
                                                "sense_id": "70fe6b4c-10e1-3dec-bf70-0b7957276117",
                                                "text": "I barely completed my homework. However, I got a score of 5 for it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a635ff53-24b8-4943-8582-ba073bdd84c9",
                                                "sense_id": "70fe6b4c-10e1-3dec-bf70-0b7957276117",
                                                "text": "It becomes, therefore, no inconsiderable part of science barely to know the different operations of mind,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9a3a0b2-e735-46a6-9bc3-ea7c39dd4b09",
                                                "sense_id": "70fe6b4c-10e1-3dec-bf70-0b7957276117",
                                                "text": "1925, Walter Anthony and Tom Reed (titles), Rupert Julian (director), The Phantom of the Opera, silent movie\n‘It is barely possible you may hear of a ghost, a Phantom of the Opera!’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bee63170-d0a6-4ef6-9f6f-1ccec79a6862",
                                                "sense_id": "70fe6b4c-10e1-3dec-bf70-0b7957276117",
                                                "text": "As our train to Paris dashed through the labyrynthine flyovers at Porchefontaine, barely a mile from Versailles, the 75 m.p.h. limit was already almost attained."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79d3db34-7231-3668-a5ce-0b604ed6f793",
                                        "entry_id": "29a03265-b143-3681-8c51-5df023293b4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Almost not at all."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8337034-14dc-4d72-a378-ac784155e37e",
                                                "sense_id": "79d3db34-7231-3668-a5ce-0b604ed6f793",
                                                "text": "The plane is so far away now I can barely see it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a2ff9f-c21c-4fb4-b89d-d6bf63df531a",
                                                "sense_id": "79d3db34-7231-3668-a5ce-0b604ed6f793",
                                                "text": "Yes, it is barely visible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fccf239f-ea93-4aa1-a47d-f5ca432b7d66",
                                                "sense_id": "79d3db34-7231-3668-a5ce-0b604ed6f793",
                                                "text": "In contrast to what was to come, City were barely allowed any time to settle on the ball in the opening exchanges, with Ashley Young prominent and drawing heavy fouls from Micah Richards and James Milner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "348770df-f65d-3560-891d-30e32d50ee4d",
                                        "entry_id": "29a03265-b143-3681-8c51-5df023293b4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Recently, just now."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67125681-408e-452a-ab2d-8c31fbd4093f",
                                                "sense_id": "348770df-f65d-3560-891d-30e32d50ee4d",
                                                "text": "I barely got to the store."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "849d33e5-3bbf-305e-a7cc-421b889b31a0",
                                        "entry_id": "29a03265-b143-3681-8c51-5df023293b4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Merely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ebec508-5eab-4376-9761-c1f299a31e40",
                                                "sense_id": "849d33e5-3bbf-305e-a7cc-421b889b31a0",
                                                "text": "Now that fire do's not alwayes barely separate the Elementary parts, but sometimes at least alter also the Ingredients of Bodies […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                        "entry_id": "29a03265-b143-3681-8c51-5df023293b4c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Openly, clearly, plainly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "comparable",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdba6f08-8ce2-4534-a95e-1950a0776598",
                                                "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                                "text": "Firſt here is the Reſurrection of our Saviour barely and poſitively affirmed, whom God hath raiſed up."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b28fc93b-1282-421e-906a-79636599b29e",
                                                "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                                "text": "And the same feeling appears in the following reign; in 1380 the commons petitioned against the plurality of wars; from time to time we have seen them vigorously endeavouring to limit, direct, and audit the expenditure on the wars, and even attempting to draw distinctions between the national and royal interests in the maintenance of the fortresses of Gascony and Brittany; but when the question is put barely before them they avoid committing themselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d62a0531-e0c0-42ff-927b-648268490bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                                "text": "Remember, I haven’t tried to embroider; I’m just laying the facts barely before you—as barely as I can—to make what you please out of."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4da877c-2f5a-430d-abaa-644eb28d9a4b",
                                                "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                                "text": "The term “brief” may appear somewhat inappropriate, as the legal brief is often a bulky document, but the sense is rather that the ideas are stated barely, without elaboration or persuasive enforcement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9225a56-0d81-4e13-8025-2d091cf21dc3",
                                                "sense_id": "c66f13c9-7652-375f-b3bc-c7605fb46d8f",
                                                "text": "Religion intervenes in the sense that it offers precepts, a code of behavior, for the guidance of believers; poetry, if written in terms of ideals and attitudes which are encompassed by religion, offers not precepts but a dramatic presentation of values. The precepts are stated barely and directly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6dd55310-3b1d-44b3-9c7e-47d0779990e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "b0c047af-822f-3bfa-9164-45da19cc6bd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "39fa258c-7bbd-326a-8da5-403059077753",
                        "source_sense_description": "bijna niet, op het nippertje",
                        "target_lang_word": "scarcely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scarcely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d6d3dd3-3828-3844-b32f-9672b248dcd9",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6184cd-4719-3fdd-bfd9-96e705e300c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Probably not."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "modal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b05090f5-58b7-4e9b-a75d-717c475dfbac",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6d3dd3-3828-3844-b32f-9672b248dcd9",
                                                "text": "One could scarcely find any trout in the stream without the stocking program."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0921b04-aa45-4ef2-a0a3-8db34f50c9a0",
                                                "sense_id": "6d6d3dd3-3828-3844-b32f-9672b248dcd9",
                                                "text": "The staff here are frequently in the news, thanks to their successful efforts to make an attractive station where travellers would scarcely expect to find one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6184cd-4719-3fdd-bfd9-96e705e300c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Certainly not, hardly at all."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "modal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d89ec62-3e87-4419-8c00-9fda27c417b4",
                                                "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                                "text": "One could scarcely expect the man to know how to fly a helicopter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1cf712da-f725-45e4-b374-c44f27765b9c",
                                                "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                                "text": "He did not enter upon the subject without being aware that government by its very nature counteracts the improvement of individual intellect; but, as the views he entertains in this particular are out of the common road, it is scarcely to be wondered at that he understood the proposition more completely as he proceeded, and saw more distinctly into the nature of the remedy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c370fe0-f350-46fd-91ce-5d629ccedf39",
                                                "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                                "text": "But, of course, this weather had put a stop to every kind of movement; for even if men could have borne the cold, they could scarcely be brought to face the perils of the snow-drifts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3049bda1-f257-4239-a836-459aca6d833e",
                                                "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                                "text": "The planet Mars, I scarcely need remind the reader, revolves about the sun at a mean distance of 140,000,000 miles, and the light and heat it receives from the sun is barely half of that received by this world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b8e2ad0-69b3-4a4d-b0f3-b08c7a9159e9",
                                                "sense_id": "28123942-1168-30ee-9265-bde039dace00",
                                                "text": "His clothes could scarcely be called shabby, at least they passed muster in the half-light, but one’s imagination could not have pictured the wearer embarking on the purchase of a half-crown box of chocolates or laying out ninepence on a carnation buttonhole."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                        "entry_id": "7f6184cd-4719-3fdd-bfd9-96e705e300c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hardly: only just; by a small margin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eeffb1b-f712-4faf-ae0b-697e9b25c3b0",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "Scarcely had she arrived when she was put to work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9be6df7f-3863-47d2-bc58-4a10ba4dc9c8",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "He had scarcely finished, when the labourer arrived who had been sent for my ransom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d63f97d1-7318-4c31-a2e8-fd6e12506311",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "It is scarcely possible to avoid comparing the eye to a telescope."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b44a95c6-9557-4d7e-99c2-4b8a490bf852",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "In 1776 manufactories scarcely existed even in name in all this vast territory."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e5b4858-7cef-4cd9-8204-24aabe3570dd",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "Scarcely had she got fairly into it, however, before the beasts closed in behind her, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d47ca7b7-c722-4776-91ab-463bc6748d84",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "“Scarcely had Alice reached her twentieth birthday, than she gave her erstwhile fiancée [sic] his formal congé.[…]”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10a39cf8-68fd-4e82-9a2f-b117fb6eea88",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "That night, and for many nights after, the Velveteen Rabbit slept in the Boy’s bed. At first he found it rather uncomfortable, for the Boy hugged him very tight, and sometimes he rolled over on him, and sometimes he pushed him so far under the pillow that the Rabbit could scarcely breathe."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac902c59-9d39-4118-bb69-c47e159053c8",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "But we shall take scarcely more than two years to reach it, while we should have needed almost as much time to arrive in the region of Proxima Centauris."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "040cd6df-6804-487c-acad-e258e307b6cd",
                                                "sense_id": "b6397fdf-f2fa-3f0f-b70a-7c6617a0b797",
                                                "text": "Nature scarcely ever gives us the very best—for that we must have recourse to art."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
